    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No. 12 Kingston Lodge to the market. This very well-maintained one bedroom apartment offers bright and spacious accommodation extending to approximately 40 sqm with the added benefit of communal parking.\n \nIdeally positioned within this popular and peaceful development overlooking mature landscaped grounds, No. 12 presents an excellent opportunity for first time buyers, investors, or those seeking a secure and low-maintenance home in a highly convenient location.\n \nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright living and dining area, a separate kitchen, a generous double bedroom, and a bathroom. \n \nThe location is particularly convenient, with Drumcondra Village just a short stroll away, offering a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and recreational amenities. Dublin City Centre is easily accessible and provides an extensive selection of retail, cultural, and leisure facilities. Excellent transport links are nearby, including several bus routes and Drumcondra Train Station, both within a short walking distance. The M1, M50, and Dublin Airport are also readily accessible."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.30m x 1.20m\nWith intercom, hot press and storage.\n\nLiving /Dining Room - 3.30m x 3.60m\nSpacious area with carpet flooring and large window flooding the room with natural light.\n\nKitchen - 2.50m x 2.20m\nSolid oak with ample storage and countertop space, washing machine, fridge and cooker.\n\nBedroom - 3.42m x 2.93m\nLarge double bedroom with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.30m x 1.70m\nPartly tiled with WC, Wash Hand Basin and bath with shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Electric radiator central heating </li><li>Communal parking </li><li>Quiet development </li><li>Service charge 1,395: 2026</li><li>Close to abundance of local amenities</li><li>Excellent transport options close by</li><li>Short commute to city centre</ul>"
      },
      {
